158	e72c2c14-3a4b-4635-9c45-5a8b2785de9d	assistant	\n# Python异步编程实现方法\n\nPython异步编程主要通过以下几种方式实现：\n\n## 1. 基本异步语法 (async/await)\n\nPython 3.5+引入了async/await语法，这是实现异步编程的基础：\n\n```python\nimport asyncio\n\nasync def fetch_data(url):\n    # 模拟异步IO操作\n    await asyncio.sleep(1)\n    return f"Data from {url}"\n\nasync def main():\n    # 创建多个异步任务\n    tasks = [\n        fetch_data("http://example.com/1"),\n        fetch_data("http://example.com/2"),\n        fetch_data("http://example.com/3")\n    ]\n    \n    # 并发执行任务\n    results = await asyncio.gather(*tasks)\n    return results\n\n# 运行异步主函数\nresults = asyncio.run(main())\n```\n\n## 2. asyncio库\n\nasyncio是Python内置的异步IO框架，提供了事件循环、任务管理和协程支持：\n\n```python\nimport asyncio\n\nasync def long_running_task():\n    print("Task started")\n    await asyncio.sleep(2)\n    print("Task completed")\n\nasync def main():\n    # 创建任务\n    task = asyncio.create_task(long_running_task())\n    \n    # 执行其他操作\n    print("Doing other work")\n    \n    # 等待任务完成\n    await task\n\nasyncio.run(main())\n```\n\n## 3. 异步IO操作\n\n对于网络请求、文件操作等IO密集型任务，可以使用异步库：\n\n```python\n# 异步HTTP请求\nimport aiohttp\n\nasync def fetch_url(session, url):\n    async with session.get(url) as response:\n        return await response.text()\n\nasync def main():\n    async with aiohttp.ClientSession() as session:\n        urls = ["http://example.com/page1", "http://example.com/page2"]\n        tasks = [fetch_url(session, url) for url in urls]\n        results = await asyncio.gather(*tasks)\n        return results\n\n# 运行\nasyncio.run(main())\n```\n\n## 4. 异步数据库操作\n\n对于数据库操作，可以使用异步驱动：\n\n```python\nimport asyncpg\n\nasync def query_data():\n    # 创建数据库连接\n    conn = await asyncpg.connect(user="user", password="password", database="db")\n    \n    # 执行查询\n    result = await conn.fetch("SELECT * FROM users WHERE age > $1", 18)\n    \n    # 关闭连接\n    await conn.close()\n    return result\n\nasyncio.run(query_data())\n```\n\n## 5. 异步Web框架\n\nFastAPI等框架原生支持异步：\n\n```python\nfrom fastapi import FastAPI\nimport httpx\n\napp = FastAPI()\n\n@app.get("/")\nasync def read_root():\n    # 异步获取外部数据\n    async with httpx.AsyncClient() as client:\n        response = await client.get("http://example.com/api")\n        return {"data": response.json()}\n```\n\n## 6. 消息队列异步处理\n\n结合您的NSQ消息队列经验：\n\n```python\nimport asyncio\nimport nsq\n\nasync def handle_message(message):\n    # 处理消息\n    print(f"Received message: {message.body}")\n    await asyncio.sleep(0.1)  # 模拟处理耗时\n    message.finish()\n\nasync def main():\n    # 创建NSQ reader\n    r = nsq.Reader(message_handler=handle_message,\n                   nsqd_tcp_addresses='127.0.0.1:4150',\n                   topic='my_topic',\n                   channel='my_channel',\n                   max_in_flight=10)\n    \n    # 启动reader\n    r.start()\n    \n    # 保持运行\n    try:\n        while True:\n            await asyncio.sleep(1)\n    except KeyboardInterrupt:\n        r.stop()\n\nasyncio.run(main())\n```\n\n## 7. 异步并发控制\n\n```python\nimport asyncio\nfrom asyncio import Semaphore\n\nasync def fetch_with_semaphore(url, semaphore):\n    async with semaphore:\n        # 模拟网络请求\n        await asyncio.sleep(1)\n        return f"Data from {url}"\n\nasync def main():\n    # 限制并发数为5\n    semaphore = Semaphore(5)\n    urls = [f"http://example.com/page{i}" for i in range(20)]\n    \n    tasks = [fetch_with_semaphore(url, semaphore) for url in urls]\n    results = await asyncio.gather(*tasks)\n    return results\n\nasyncio.run(main())\n```\n\n异步编程特别适合IO密集型任务，如网络请求、数据库操作、文件读写等场景，能够有效提高程序并发性能。根据您的简历经验，这种技术在处理LLM应用、可观测平台等高并发系统中非常有价值。	2025-11-17 05:40:14.677733	{}
