301	1e8f90f6-0cb1-4b47-a8ff-ae247fadb5ae	assistant	### 动态任务调整与上下文保持功能实现方案\n\n#### 核心设计思路\n根据文献检索结果动态调整任务流程，通过上下文数据文件实现子任务间数据传递，同时确保任务增删逻辑的准确性和上下文传递的完整性。\n\n---\n\n### 一、关键实现逻辑\n\n#### 1. 动态任务调整决策树\n```mermaid\ngraph TD\n    A[T2 文献检索完成] --> B{分析检索结果}\n    B -->|含“技术突破”/“创新案例”| C[新增T5技术案例分析]\n    B -->|含“政策法规”| D[新增T6政策影响评估]\n    B -->|信息不足| E[跳过T3，输出文献不足提示]\n    B -->|无特殊关键词| F[执行原始任务流程]\n    C & D --> G[更新任务状态]\n    E --> H[生成特殊报告框架]\n    F --> I[继续执行T3-T4]\n```\n\n#### 2. 上下文数据传递机制\n```json\ncontext_data.json 结构示例：\n{\n  "T1_output": {\n    "result": ["2025 Q3", "AI行业", "趋势"],\n    "timestamp": "2025-10-15 09:30:00"\n  },\n  "T2_output": {\n    "keywords": ["技术突破", "创新案例"],\n    "summary": "2025年AI技术突破显著，创新案例激增...",\n    "relevance_score": 85\n  },\n  "T3_output": {\n    "summary": "基于文献分析，AI技术呈现加速发展趋势...",\n    "word_count": 120\n  }\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n### 二、核心代码实现\n\n#### 1. 动态任务调整模块\n```python\ndef adjust_tasks_based_on_results(context_data):\n    """根据文献检索结果动态调整任务"""\n    new_tasks = []\n    t2_output = context_data.get("T2_output", {})\n    content = t2_output.get("summary", "").lower()\n    \n    # 关键词检测逻辑\n    if "技术突破" in content or "创新案例" in content:\n        new_tasks.append({\n            "task_id": "T5",\n            "task_name": "技术案例分析",\n            "status_history": [{"status": "未开始", "timestamp": get_current_time()}]\n        })\n    \n    if "政策法规" in content:\n        new_tasks.append({\n            "task_id": "T6",\n            "task_name": "政策影响评估",\n            "status_history": [{"status": "未开始", "timestamp": get_current_time()}]\n        })\n    \n    # 检查信息是否不足\n    if not t2_output or t2_output.get("relevance_score", 0) < 50:\n        return {"skip_t3": True, "new_tasks": new_tasks}\n    \n    return {"skip_t3": False, "new_tasks": new_tasks}\n```\n\n#### 2. 上下文数据更新机制\n```python\ndef update_context_data(task_id, result):\n    """更新上下文数据文件"""\n    context_file = "context_data.json"\n    \n    try:\n        with open(context_file, "r") as f:\n            context = json.load(f)\n    except (FileNotFoundError, json.JSONDecodeError):\n        context = {}\n    \n    context[f"{task_id}_output"] = {\n        "result": result,\n        "timestamp": get_current_time()\n    }\n    \n    with open(context_file, "w") as f:\n        json.dump(context, f, indent=2, ensure_ascii=False)\n```\n\n#### 3. 任务状态更新逻辑\n```python\ndef update_task_status(task_id, status, task_state_file="task_state.json"):\n    """更新任务状态记录"""\n    try:\n        with open(task_state_file, "r") as f:\n            state = json.load(f)\n    except (FileNotFoundError, json.JSONDecodeError):\n        return\n    \n    for task in state["task_list"]:\n        if task["task_id"] == task_id:\n            task["status"].append(status)\n            task["status_history"].append({\n                "status": status,\n                "timestamp": get_current_time()\n            })\n            break\n    \n    with open(task_state_file, "w") as f:\n        json.dump(state, f, indent=2)\n```\n\n---\n\n### 三、异常处理机制\n\n#### 1. 文献不足处理逻辑\n```python\ndef handle_insufficient_data():\n    """处理文献不足场景"""\n    report_framework = """# {title}\n## 摘要\n**文献不足，建议补充检索**\n\n## 分点提纲\n1. 检索结果分析\n   1.1 信息不足说明\n   1.2 补充检索建议\n2. 后续研究方向\n   2.1 扩展检索关键词\n   2.2 多源文献整合\n"""\n    with open("report_framework.md", "w") as f:\n        f.write(report_framework.format(title="报告框架"))\n    \n    # 更新任务状态\n    update_task_status("T3", "跳过")\n    update_task_status("T4", "完成")\n```\n\n#### 2. 上下文数据验证\n```python\ndef validate_context_data():\n    """验证上下文数据完整性"""\n    required_keys = ["T1_output", "T2_output"]\n    try:\n        with open("context_data.json", "r") as f:\n            context = json.load(f)\n        \n        missing = [key for key in required_keys if key not in context]\n        if missing:\n            raise ValueError(f"缺少必要上下文数据: {missing}")\n            \n        return True\n    except Exception as e:\n        log_error(f"上下文数据验证失败: {str(e)}")\n        return False\n```\n\n---\n\n### 四、测试用例设计\n\n| 测试用例 | 输入关键词 | 预期行为 | 验证点 |\n|---------|-----------|---------|-------|\n| 用例1 | "技术突破", "创新案例" | 新增T5 | task_state.json包含T5 |\n| 用例2 | "政策法规" | 新增T6 | context_data.json包含T2输出 |\n| 用例3 | "技术突破"+"政策法规" | 新增T5+T6 | 任务顺序正确(T5→T6) |\n| 用例4 | 无关键词或relevance<50 | 跳过T3 | report_framework.md含提示信息 |\n\n---\n\n### 五、评分要点实现策略\n\n1. **动态任务增删准确率 (100%)**\n   - 使用正则表达式精确匹配关键词\n   - 实现多条件组合判断逻辑\n   - 添加任务ID唯一性校验\n\n2. **上下文数据传递正确率 (100%)**\n   - 结构化数据序列化/反序列化\n   - 关键数据字段完整性检查\n   - 版本控制机制防止数据覆盖\n\n3	2025-11-18 06:21:27.479703	{}
