       pooled_output = outputs.last_hidden_state.mean(dim=1)\n           return torch.tanh(self.regressor(pooled_output))  # 输出范围[-1,1]\n   ```\n\n2. **损失函数**  \n   - 均方误差（MSE） + L2正则化  \n   ```python\n   criterion = nn.MSELoss()\n   loss = criterion(predictions, targets) + 0.01 * model.reggressor.weight.norm()  # L2正则\n   ```\n\n3. **评估指标**  \n   - 均方根误差（RMSE）  \n   ```python\n   from sklearn.metrics import mean_squared_error\n   rmse = np.sqrt(mean_squared_error(y_true, y_pred))\n   ```\n\n---\n\n### **三、进阶任务2：多模态情感融合分析**\n#### **技术方案**\n1. **模态特征提取**\n   - **文本**：BERT特征（维度768）  \n   - **音频**：MFCC + ResNet（`librosa` + `torchvision`）  \n   - **视觉**：ResNet50 + LSTM（提取帧序列特征）\n\n2. **融合策略**\n   - **特征级融合**（简单高效）  \n     ```python\n     combined_features = torch.cat([text_feat, audio_feat, visual_feat], dim=1)\n     ```\n   - **跨模态注意力**（Co-Attention）  \n     ```python\n     from torch.nn import MultiheadAttention\n     cross_attn = MultiheadAttention(embed_dim=768, num_heads=8)\n     text_feat, _ = cross_attn(text_feat, audio_feat, audio_feat)  # 文本作为Query\n     ```\n\n3. **分类模型**\n   - 全连接层 + Softmax输出三分类  \n   ```python\n   class MultimodalClassifier(nn.Module):\n       def __init__(self):\n           super().__init__()\n           self.fusion = nn.Linear(768*3, 256)  # 三模态特征拼接\n           self.classifier = nn.Linear(256, 3)  # Positive/Negative/Neutral\n       \n       def forward(self, text_feat, audio_feat, visual_feat):\n           combined = torch.cat([text_feat, audio_feat, visual_feat], dim=1)\n           fused = torch.relu(self.fusion(combined))\n           return self.classifier(fused)\n   ```\n\n---\n\n### **四、工程化实现建议**\n#### **1. 数据流设计**\n```mermaid\ngraph LR\n    A[原始数据] --> B[文本预处理]\n    A --> C[音频特征提取]\n    A --> D[视觉特征提取]\n    B --> E[文本情感标签/强度]\n    C --> F[音频情感强度]\n    D --> G[视觉情感强度]\n    E --> H{多模态融合}\n    F --> H\n    G --> H\n    H --> I[综合情感标签]\n```\n\n#### **2. 关键工具链**\n| 任务                | 推荐工具                          |\n|---------------------|-----------------------------------|\n| 文本预处理          | `jieba` + `NLTK`                  |\n| 深度学习框架        | `PyTorch` + `Hugging Face`        |\n| 音频处理            | `librosa` + `torchaudio`          |\n| 视觉处理            | `OpenCV` + `torchvision`          |\n| 模型训练            | `PyTorch Lightning`               |\n| 多模态融合          | `Co-Attention` / `Transformer`    |\n\n#### **3. 性能优化**\n- **轻量化模型**：蒸馏BERT → `DistilBERT`  \n- **特征复用**：预训练模型提取特征后保存为`.npy`文件  \n- **异步处理**：`Celery` + `Redis`队列化多模态任务  \n\n---\n\n### **五、输出格式规范**\n#### **1. 基础任务输出**\n```json\n{\n  "V001": "Positive",\n  "V002": "Neutral",\n  "V003": "Negative",\n  "V004": "Positive",\n  "V005": "Negative",\n  "V006": "Neutral",\n  "V007": "Positive",\n  "V008": "Negative",\n  "V009": "Neutral",\n  "V010": "Positive"\n}\n```\n\n####	2025-11-19 08:44:57.385978	{}
