33	服务启动成功\n	根据提供的上下文，我找到了关于"服务启动成功"的信息。在文档Logs_3.txt和Logs_3.txt_chunk_1中，有以下日志记录：\n\n```\n2023-07-04 07:15:13,310 [4] INFO   [(null)] - 服务启动成功\n```\n\n这条日志明确记录了服务启动成功的消息，时间戳为2023年7月4日07:15:13。从上下文来看，服务启动成功之前经历了以下步骤：\n1. 执行线程状态改变为Pause状态\n2. 监控AddThread的信号量\n3. 加载执行计划（共2个计划任务）\n4. 执行线程状态改变为Run状态\n5. 最终服务启动成功\n\n服务启动成功后，系统开始调度SplunkServer任务，并向https://172.16.30.13:8089/services/auth/login发送登录请求。	[{"id": 19, "content": "48940,0x0,0,4294967295,,,39754ce9-d61c-406b-85b7-333819759c6c,0\\",\\"_serial\\":\\"0\\",\\"_si\\":\\"96b42dec6237,main\\",\\"_sourcetype\\":\\"syslog\\",\\"_time\\":\\"2023-06-30 11:49:19.000 UTC\\"}]\\n2023-06-30 12:09:25,947 [3] DEBUG  [(null)] - QUERY_STR==>> search earliest=-1h (172.16.90.60 OR 172.16.60.60 OR www.abc.com) AND _indextime>=1688123365 | eval src_ip=coalesce(src_ip,c_ip,src,\\"Unknown\\") | eval dest_ip=coalesce(dest_ip,dest,dst,\\"Unknown\\") | eval src_port=coalesce(src_port,s_port,\\"Unknown\\") | eval dest_port=coalesce(dest_port,\\"Unknown\\") | eval sig_id=coalesce(sig_id,severity_id,\\"Unknown\\") | eval filehashes=coalesce(sha256sum,sha1sum,md5sum,\\"Unknown\\") | eval name=coalesce(name,threat_name,event,signature,signature_id,action,\\"Unknown\\") | eval host=coalesce(host,sourcetype,\\"Unknown\\") | fields src_ip,dest_ip,sig_id,src_port,dest_port,filehashes,name,event_time,host | dedup src_ip,dest_ip,src_port,dest_port,_time,name \\nRESULT DATA: [{\\"src_ip\\":\\"Unknown\\",\\"dest_ip\\":\\"Unknown\\",\\"sig_id\\":\\"Unknown\\",\\"src_port\\":\\"Unknown\\",\\"dest_port\\":\\"Unknown\\",\\"filehashes\\":\\"Unknown\\",\\"name\\":\\"Unknown\\",\\"host\\":\\"172.16.10.4\\",\\"_bkt\\":\\"main~0~0485BC38-ACAF-4C54-8048-20D6CE294065\\",\\"_cd\\":\\"0:7358\\",\\"_indextime\\":\\"1688125759\\",\\"_kv\\":\\"1\\",\\"_raw\\":\\"Jun 30 11:49:19 172.16.10.4 Jun 30 19:49:57 PA220-test 1,2023/06/30 19:49:56,012801125035,THREAT,wildfire-virus,2304,2023/06/30 19:49:56,172.16.90.60,172.16.60.60,0.0.0.0,0.0.0.0,allow-ActorA-90.93,,,web-browsing